CU(1)               UNIX Programmer's Manual                  CU(1)



NAME
     cu - serial terminal (same program as tip)

SYNOPSIS
     cu [ tty00 | tty01 | /dev/ttyNN ]

DESCRIPTION
     _C_u is _t_i_p under its other name; the two are one program
     and behave identically.  See tip(1) for the escapes and
     details.

SEE ALSO
     tip(1)

